<title>USA: Standard Financial Inc Q3 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Standard Financial Inc Q3 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.07   profit	 $0.22</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,006   profit	 3,746</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 includes one-time charge of $5.8 million for recapitalization of the Savings Association Insurance Fund. Excluding SAIF charge, earnings were $0.31 a share.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 also includes gain of $1.1 million, or about $0.04 a share, for sale of credit card operations.  </p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.49		    $0.73</p>
<p> Net			  7,733		   12,540</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding SAIF charge, nine months net income was $13.5 million, or $0.87 a share.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
